{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101190","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210119001:1":{"text":"형씨! 뭐 좀 물을게. 오늘 바다에서 뭐 건진 것 좀 없어?","source_cn":"嘿，伙计，打听点事，今天有没有在海里捞上青头？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5CDDC05A9C8A1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210119002:1":{"text":"살아있는 건 없고, 죽은 건 꽤 많지. 근처에서 배가 또 습격을 당한 모양이야.","source_cn":"活的没有，死的不少。看来附近又有船遇袭了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B56C860DBFBD394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210119003:1":{"text":"당신 뒤에 있는 건 누구지?","source_cn":"你后面跟的什么人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3020DE9BF92035E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210119004:1":{"text":"길 가다 만난 녀석들이야. 수영엔 영 소질이 없더군.","source_cn":"捡回来的旱鸭子，不，旱耗子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93673F3F310ABA3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210119005:1":{"text":"이봐, 너희가 찾는 그 녀석, 어떻게 생겼지?","source_cn":"喂，你们丢的那个人长什么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2775DDF0F2F4EFE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210119006:1":{"text":"치피는 저랑 비슷한 키에... 기사 갑옷을 입고 타조 깃털을 단 투구를 쓰고 있어요.","source_cn":"满满和我差不多高……穿着骑士的盔甲，戴有鸵羽的头盔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE872CF44F3BF236C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210119007:1":{"text":"어라, 이 녀석 말을 할 줄 아네! 희한한 녀석일세! 파는 건가?","source_cn":"嘿，这小东西会说话！够稀奇！卖吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54F4C29C65162CA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1210119007":{"text":"어라, 이 녀석 말을 할 줄 아네! 희한한 녀석일세! 파는 건가?","source_cn":"嘿，这小东西会说话！够稀奇！卖吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54F4C29C65162CA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210119008:1":{"text":"그냥 물어본 것뿐이야. 이런 생명체는 보기 힘드니까.","source_cn":"我就问问。长她这样的，没瞧见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB57793DA509A9F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210119009:1":{"text":"기사 갑옷을 입고 있다고? 그럼 가망 없을 거야. 이렇게 큰 파도에 그런 거추장스러운 것까지 입고 있으면 물에 뜨기 힘들 테니까.","source_cn":"你们说还穿着骑士盔甲？那恐怕凶多吉少了。这么大的浪头，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36145EC8EEA58588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210119010:1":{"text":"아니에요! 치피는 무사할 거라고요, 그럴 리가...!","source_cn":"不！满满他不会有事的，不可能……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4A4867B7A5EB7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210119011:1":{"text":"아, 알겠어. 고마워, 형씨!","source_cn":"行，行，谢谢了，老兄！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F6E86EAEE9DD215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210119012:1":{"text":"어, 어떻게 가망이 없다는 말을 할 수 있죠!","source_cn":"那个人竟然、竟然说满满凶多吉少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00705CAC689AE84D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210119013:1":{"text":"일리가 있는 말이야. 나도 같은 생각이거든.","source_cn":"他说得很有道理，我本来也想那么说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9557D57DF923AE67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210119014:1":{"text":"뭐라고요?! 다, 당신까지...","source_cn":"什么？！你、连你也——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60810A4A5A11ADC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210119015:1":{"text":"침착하라고. 일리가 있긴 하지만 만일이라는 게 있잖아? 어쨌거나 너희 둘도 이렇게 살아 있으니까.","source_cn":"别急别急，道理是那么讲，不过，万一呢？毕竟我都把你们两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4566